    },
    "body": "I did this change because the cmd_duration feature was broken on my bash configuration. I recently switch to Manjaro Linux and there the default bash configuration sets the  PROMPT_COMMAND variable and breaking the cmd_duration feature.\r\nChanging the order of the concatenation seems to fix the problem for me.\r\n\r\nCheck my new commit. I hope to have fixed your issue.\r\nIn addition to that, I added a check to avoid the concatenation of multiple sharship_cmd function ones after the other in the case of multiple calls to `eval \"$(starship init bash)\"`.",
